<view class="gift-page"><view class="gift-heading gift-welcome"><view class="gift-kicker">A GIFT, JUST FOR YOU</view><view class="gift-title">有一份心意，送给你。</view><view class="gift-copy">领取后，选择适合自己的尺码。</view></view><brand-loading wx:if="{{loading}}" label="正在打开赠礼…"/><view class="gift-error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<button class="gift-link vk-button-content" bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">重新核对</button></view><block wx:if="{{gift && !loading}}"><image class="gift-hero" src="{{gift.image}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="gift-section"><view class="gift-card__name">{{gift.productName}}</view><view class="gift-card__meta">{{gift.description}}</view><view class="gift-quote" wx:if="{{gift.message}}">“{{gift.message}}”</view></view><view class="gift-note">商品已由礼品卡包含，无需再支付商品款项。款式、颜色和条数固定，运费按收礼地址另计，确认前会显示。领取后绑定当前账号；缺货时卡片保留，可稍后兑换。</view><button class="gift-primary gift-confirm vk-button-content" wx:if="{{gift.owned}}" bindtap="openGift">查看我的礼物</button><view class="gift-empty" wx:elif="{{gift.alreadyClaimed}}">这份礼物已被领取</view><button class="gift-primary gift-confirm vk-button-content" wx:else bindtap="claim" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">{{loggedIn ? '领取这份礼物' : '登录并领取'}}</button></block><button class="gift-link vk-button-content" bindtap="goWallet">查看我的礼品卡 ↗</button><button class="gift-link vk-button-content" bindtap="goService">联系客服 ↗</button></view>
<privacy-sheet id="privacy-sheet"/>
